    {
      "subId": "7510308",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "751030801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "751030801": {
            "id": "751030801",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wow, that's a ton of fish!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751030802"
            ]
          },
          "751030802": {
            "id": "751030802",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Pania",
            "text": "#Wait, don't move, {M#Big Bro}{F#Big Sis} Blondie! Those are bait to attract Flowcurrent Birds!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751030803"
            ]
          },
          "751030803": {
            "id": "751030803",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Uh, attract Flowcurrent Birds?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751030804"
            ]
          },
          "751030804": {
            "id": "751030804",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Pania",
            "text": "Yeah! Iwai and I are waiting for the Flowcurrent Birds to return to shore. Not much else to do right now, anyway.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751030805"
            ]
          },
          "751030805": {
            "id": "751030805",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Iwai",
            "text": "Hrroo, roooh!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751030806"
            ]
          },
          "751030806": {
            "id": "751030806",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Pania",
            "text": "Alright, come on, Iwai. You're a good kid, aren't you? Now be patient. There's no need to rush.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751030807"
            ]
          },
          "751030807": {
            "id": "751030807",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Iwai",
            "text": "Rroo...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751030808"
            ]
          },
          "751030808": {
            "id": "751030808",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Pania",
            "text": "Anyway, our original plan was to come down here to play. I mean, no one else usually comes down here other than Uncle Rongo anyway, so this is our super secret base... or something like that!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751030809"
            ]
          },
          "751030809": {
            "id": "751030809",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Pania",
            "text": "But we didn't think that these birds would steal a march on us today.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751030810"
            ]
          },
          "751030810": {
            "id": "751030810",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Pania",
            "text": "And that's why I've got all this fish ready to lure them over with. Flowcurrent Birds love the stuff!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751030816",
              "751030813"
            ]
          },
          "751030816": {
            "id": "751030816",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Pania",
            "text": "Yeah. Could be that we're too far away, and they can't smell the fish? If only we could get 'em ashore somehow...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751030817"
            ]
          },
          "751030817": {
            "id": "751030817",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Pania",
            "text": "If Uncle Rongo was here, he'd say something like <color=#00E1FFFF>\"Just boop them all ashore, why don't you?\"</color>... Iwai and I don't have the raw strength for that though. They'd blow us away instead, I'd bet.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751030818"
            ]
          },
          "751030818": {
            "id": "751030818",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Hmm... Why don't we give that a try instead, {NICKNAME}? If we could get them to come ashore, they might be attracted to the fish then!"
          },
          "751030813": {
            "id": "751030813",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Pania",
            "text": "Round like a roly-poly, and fond of fish... Yeah, I can see where you're coming from.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751030814"
            ]
          },
          "751030814": {
            "id": "751030814",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Iwai",
            "text": "Mmm! Mmmm!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751030815"
            ]
          },
          "751030815": {
            "id": "751030815",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What? No! Anyway, back to the point — you haven't lured any Flowcurrent Birds over at all!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
